{"name": "Diorama Break", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>The special tactics JRPG that lets You talk directly to the Hero.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marshal your wits and fight your way through <strong>turn-based battles</strong> and <strong>awkward conversations</strong> alike. Choose your words and actions with care. Or don't. See what happens...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the onset, you (yes, <strong>you </strong>\ud83e\udef5)\u00a0will be connected to a hero with his own plans, hopes, and fears, in a world that has raised him for this role. Soon after, more allies join him. Question them, advise them, and guide them on their way. <strong>Your treatment of them will shape how events unfold.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a vibrant world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/824bcf048410a79f4614a3b84b73c154.poster.avif?t=1787623761\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/824bcf048410a79f4614a3b84b73c154.webm?t=1787623761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/824bcf048410a79f4614a3b84b73c154.mp4?t=1787623761\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Branching dialogue with interjections</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/63b51749116cd64ee80658f82503d108.gif?t=1787623761\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/63b51749116cd64ee80658f82503d108.poster.avif?t=1787623761\"/></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An unorthodox\u00a0tactical battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/3f5fcd6cf281eb70ac0bdd2895a6ed12.poster.avif?t=1787623761\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/3f5fcd6cf281eb70ac0bdd2895a6ed12.webm?t=1787623761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/3f5fcd6cf281eb70ac0bdd2895a6ed12.mp4?t=1787623761\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turns are split into 6 substeps, actions have varying substep durations and areas of effect. Slower actions might hit harder, while faster actions can be easier to land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both Player and Enemy units queue multiple actions ahead of time, then execute them concurrently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time your actions and movements carefully to hit your opponents before they hit you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by fighting game concepts such as footsies, frame data, and attack interruption.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight challenging battles with multiple units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/1b9b52cfa1126e16ee487801c54bd274.poster.avif?t=1787623761\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/1b9b52cfa1126e16ee487801c54bd274.webm?t=1787623761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/extras/1b9b52cfa1126e16ee487801c54bd274.mp4?t=1787623761\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A varied soundtrack (with genre inspirations including jazz fusion, electronic, and folk music) which reacts dynamically to gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A narrative with layers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on top of a custom 2D game engine.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "The special tactics JRPG where you can talk directly to the Hero (whether he wants it or not). Fight through tactical turn-based battles and awkward conversations alike.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932580/15e1e92d3c2b530ac9142a1879257fd66575cdca/header.jpg?t=1787623761", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Choices Matter", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Dialogue Heavy", "Tactical RPG", "JRPG", "Exploration"], "developers": "Diorama Break Team", "publishers": "Diorama Break Team", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3932580", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JxU5R3nxUgU", "first_seen": 1775512800.0, "review_rank": 889}